WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.490
"BEACH QUEEN CONTEST"

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.330
Narumi, it's me, Masaru.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.210
We've saved up quite a lot of money
for our circus performance.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.420
But we're still a bit short.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.710
Number 20, Shirogane.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.180
And the winner is Miss Shirogane!

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.350
So, how do you plan
to spend the prize money?

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.350
With your boyfriend, perhaps?

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.980
I will spend it with my family.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:38.530
Wow, that's admirable.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.570
My family is called the Nakamachi Circus.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:45.870
It's still a small circus,
but it will become big someday.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:49.330
Here they are. The Nakamachi Circus!

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.920
All right! We can run a show now!

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:57.670
It's almost showtime
for the Nakamachi Circus.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.890
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:16.900
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:21.530
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.240
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:30.870
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.750
My hands are full of emptiness

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:40.460
Please, just once, nod for me

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:45.340
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:50.260
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:54.940
All the rest can just burn away

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:59.820
What's right for me is for me alone

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:04.820
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:09.330
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.910
For one single reason

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:21.000
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.470
#8 Moment's beginning, moment's end

00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:34.230
It's finally opening day,
huh Lise?

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:35.890
Yes!

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:40.860
Come to think of it,
why did you become a wild beast tamer?

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.900
I wouldn't call myself that.

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:46.030
I only tame dogs and cats.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.240
Just a keeper of little furballs.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.700
Oh, really?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:56.790
My family were all wild beast tamers
in the Great Long Circus.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:01.500
So naturally,
I became a wild beast tamer, too.

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.960
But there was an accident.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.670
An accident?

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.840
There was a tiger named Beast,
and my sister...

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.300
No, did she...

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.850
Yes, she was killed.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:19.690
Since then, I haven't been able
to tame wild animals.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:25.030
My mind was too full of revenge
towards Beast.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.320
Even now?

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:29.530
I don't know.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:32.450
I think part of me still feels that way.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.200
Right.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.910
But I want to see you perform.

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.210
My performance?

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:44.710
Yeah, isn't it what
you want to do the most?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:48.880
Yes, I love the circus.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:52.970
I'm glad you don't let
your revenge control you.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:57.980
Yes, it's more fun to tame
than to be controlled.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:03:59.480
Yeah!

00:03:59.770 --> 00:04:01.150
There.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.280
What are you looking at?

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.870
Dear me.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.870
Don't worry,
I'm not after your boy anymore.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:18.790
Good.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:25.290
I didn't think I'd be able
to be in a circus ever again.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.260
I'm just so happy now.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.340
Like being reunited with an old boyfriend.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:36.010
You love a guy so much,
and give your everything to him.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:41.190
You break up,
but can't seem to forget him.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.610
Just as you think you've gotten over him,
you bump into him.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:50.950
And you think,
he is the only man for me.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.700
That's what the circus is like for me.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:56.660
I see.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:01.410
And you?
Ever been through something like that?

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:06.920
You play it cool, but you're pretty
so you must've had a guy or two.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:11.800
A guy you let walk right into your heart.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.640
I've had none.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:23.640
I've never opened my heart to anyone.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.730
I only attacked.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.860
I treated him like an object.

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:33.820
He scolded me.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.820
And I told him about my past.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.540
-That's it?
-Yes.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.330
He's a man that I caused
irremediable damage to.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.630
If I could see him just one more time...

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:54.680
I'd apologize from the bottom of my heart.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:02.980
-So you were pretty crazy over him.
-Crazy?

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.020
It means you loved him.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:09.270
I don't know.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.780
Wow, I never thought I'd see you
looking like that.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:15.610
So, where is this hunk now?

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.370
He's nowhere.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.540
He's dead.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:26.710
"NAKAMACHI CIRCUS
OPENING DAY"

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:31.960
SAME DAY, OVER THE PACIFIC OCEAN
HEADED TOWARDS SHANGHAI

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:35.590
He's asleep, huh?

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:40.470
Does he realize that we're headed
for China to catch the automata?

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.220
Absurd, indeed.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.900
I... I'm sorry. My sister...

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.400
Thank you. Let's go.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:07:00.070
Awkward as always.
You scared the little kids.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.580
You were awake?

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:04.750
You're only a smooth talker
towards women, eh?

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.370
No need elsewhere.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.000
Ugh, that's what I hate about you.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:15.050
Sir, are you feeling okay?

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:20.010
I'm feeling just wonderful...

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:23.600
about what's going to happen now.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:30.440
I thought so.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.980
You noticed too?

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:34.020
I'm no fool.

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.780
Be careful now.

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:41.200
This game has just begun.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.200
Yeah, a real fun game.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:47.460
If this plane crashes, we automata win.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:51.500
And if you land safely, you win.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:52.750
Shut the hell up.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.380
Narumi, no!

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:07.560
Air Control, this is RH824.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:09.440
An explosion in the cabin!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:14.110
Descending to 11,000 feet
to eliminate the need for oxygen masks.

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.240
I'm Magdalen.

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:21.240
Let's play a game, shall we?

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.030
A hijack?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.830
No, automata.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.080
What do you want?

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.120
For you to all die.

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:33.500
Damn it, it exploded
the second I stabbed it.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.040
That's why I tried to stop you.

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:39.720
They're "Self-destructors."
They explode if you cut or stab them.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:43.300
What a mess you've made now.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.310
It's stable now.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.810
Time to set up the playing field.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.270
Come on now, play with us.

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.110
What do you want to do?

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:01.700
We've heard the rumors of
a new shirogane

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:05.160
who kills automata with his bare hands.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.330
I brought 9 friends who want to fight him.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.790
Don't worry, we won't explode
if it's by bare hands.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:19.880
If you can beat us all,
this plane will land safely in Shanghai.

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.970
I guess I'll send you all flying then.

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.930
Lucille, keep the passengers back.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:31.480
Go ahead.
We want a clear, open playing field.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.900
But Guy, you need to take off
Olympia's strings.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:37.020
Right.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.020
That and...

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:42.030
What are you doing!

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:47.530
Each time we hit you,
we'll break a finger.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.620
You filthy bastard!

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.410
That's an interesting idea.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:58.000
I didn't know automata understood
aristocratic decadence and brutality.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:09:59.630
You asshole!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:03.050
I hate you almost as much as
I hate the automata.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.720
Forgive me. I don't feel pain.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.890
So I don't understand
the pain humans feel.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:15.100
But why don't you break
some precious fingers instead?

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.650
Aren't these fingers pretty?

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:23.900
They've broken many of your kind
by using Olympia.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:28.030
A wonderful idea.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.700
What the hell are you thinking?

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.830
It's definitely not for the children.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.120
Don't let them get a single hit.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:40.250
Remember, I hate you.
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.300
It's game on!

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:50.430
That's one hit.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.600
You...!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:57.190
You might have dodged it,
but he nicked you. That's a hit.

00:10:57.350 --> 00:10:58.440
Damn you.

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:02.690
If you have the time to yell,
hurry up and crush them.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.240
No matter how many fingers they break,
I don't feel a thing.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:12.330
Fine, I'll just take my time then.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.700
Because I hate your guts!

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:19.080
It doesn't hurt
to have his fingers broken?

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:23.250
Are all you shirogane like that?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:30.010
Avoiding human contact, and not caring
when a child is in danger?

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:33.810
I don't get you at all.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:41.150
Even the oldest shirogane can do nothing
without her damned puppet.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:46.280
That saber is from the Napoleonic era.
I'm fond of the brass work on the hilt.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.200
Get your filthy hands off it.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:51.870
You can't use it anyways
since it makes us explode.

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.910
Have you even considered

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:57.370
what you'll do if Narumi breaks you all?

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.290
He won't.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:03.670
Besides, you really think us on the plane
are the only ones here?

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.970
There's more fun in store for you.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.050
So there's a detached force.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:17.220
They must've overrun the cockpit too.
I'll have to take it back.

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:25.860
What's wrong? He's running out of fingers.

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.820
Or don't you care about him?

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.530
Shut up!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.780
Did I do that on purpose?

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.620
You bastards keep your hands off him.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.620
Sure, as long as he doesn't interfere.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.420
Stand back, boy.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.670
But his fingers...

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.420
Don't worry, it doesn't hurt him.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:52.340
But look at them. It has to hurt.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:55.600
Nah, he doesn't feel a thing.

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:59.220
That's right.
This isn't the time to show pain.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.190
It'd just scare the kids.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.520
I don't feel pain.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.900
Don't worry.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:12.570
That imbecile muscleman
will crush all these puppets.

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:15.870
So watch very carefully.

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.450
Man up. Don't cry.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.250
Guy, you...!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.500
Yeah, listen to that scary
mama's boy doctor.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:28.960
Watch, I won't let them lay
a single finger on me.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:41.060
Done.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:43.980
You really did defeat them all.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:46.690
But I'm not like the other automata.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:49.360
I'm fast, and I hurt.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.320
So what?

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.900
Bring it on, you rotten toy!

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:58.740
The cockpit is dead, the sky is mine.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.620
Woo, this feels great!

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:07.500
Be it the sky or a lowly bug on the land,
nothing on this earth is the automata's.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.260
Lucille, it's you.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.760
Time for some fun!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.770
I'll explode if you stab me!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.440
You all are such simpletons.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:29.900
Do you realize how long
we've been researching you?

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:33.400
We know how to crush you
without letting you explode.

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:37.320
Our fingers have memorized it.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:42.080
My synthetic body fluids are leaking...

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.080
Give me human blood!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:53.090
I didn't want to use
my new Blade of Saint George on you.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:56.970
Idiot, you just made me self-destruct...

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:58.720
Narumi, the children!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.220
No, Guy!

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:10.060
As Shakespeare said...

00:15:10.230 --> 00:15:15.990
it is more worthy to leap in ourselves,
than tarry till they push us.

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.860
Are you out of your mind!

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.370
I had no choice. You forced me to.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:22.660
Never do that again.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:23.870
Sorry.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.540
But you had no choice either.

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:28.790
It wasn't all that bad
for a monkey brain like you.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.460
Enough of that, look outside.

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.340
What the heck?

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.090
Mr. Spazza's balloon show!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.390
Insectoid automata.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:43.100
-They're after the engines.
-What?

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.560
Guy, Narumi. Do you hear me?

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.360
They got the pilots.

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:56.610
I'm steering the plane now,
but they're attacking the engines.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:57.690
Stop them.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.110
But how?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.240
I'm going outside. Hold on.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:04.620
Look at you. How can you...?

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:06.580
I'm going hunting.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.210
-What the...
-It's a new dress.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.960
A compilation of all the shiroganes'
latest technologies.

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:18.380
You idiot!
How can you fight them in your condition?

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:23.140
You only have 3 fingers left
to control Olympia with.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:27.890
They got the second engine.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.440
Narumi, I'm a shirogane.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:35.690
A heartless non-human being,
just like you said.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:42.280
That's why I can destroy the automata
no matter the circumstances.

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:43.910
Guy!

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:47.910
Besides, who else can eliminate them
in this situation?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.330
As if you could do anything.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.040
-Say that again!
-Maman!

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:58.670
You stay by your maman.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:01.300
And hold your sister tightly.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:03.680
You're her elder brother.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.390
Good.

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:11.890
I take it back. You aren't heartless.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:15.400
Not again. You people make too much of me.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.740
Teacher,

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.490
you're a kind person.

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:28.370
You just don't show it.

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:32.370
Narumi, finish everything off.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.000
Destroy the Midnight Circus.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.630
You don't mean to die out there, do you?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.260
Who do you think I am?

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:43.090
I'm not like some foolish Asian I know of.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:47.930
You better come back so I can punch you.

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:49.770
How barbaric.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:54.190
I wish you'd say something
a bit more chic, like...

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.060
Bon voyage.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.110
Thank you.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:04.030
It's finally happening.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.700
Yes, it certainly is.

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:09.580
All right, get ready now.

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:10.990
Yes, sir!

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:22.300
Damn you!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:26.340
But you'll run out of bullets in no time!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.270
See? I told you so.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:36.810
Damn it.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.190
You lose.

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:42.110
Cut me.

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:46.280
Take my head if you wish.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:48.410
But let the plane go!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:51.450
What a sight! Guy is pleading with me.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:54.410
Sure thing,
I'll chop your head off for you.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.540
And then knock the plane
out of the sky too!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.590
Thanks for coming up closer.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:10.010
You were faking it? I'll kill you!

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:14.270
By the way, I'm not out of bullets either.

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:20.270
Damn it! I'll take the plane with me then.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.190
He's going to self-destruct.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.780
I win!

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:39.920
Guy!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.300
Narumi, do something about the pests
on the left wing.

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.550
Damn it.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:51.930
We're going to crash land.
Brace yourselves!

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.680
Don't worry, I'm right here.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:05.900
Thank you all for waiting.

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:09.910
I welcome you to the Nakamachi Circus!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.450
It's time.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:14.580
Our circus is opening.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.290
-What's that?
-It came from the ocean.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:24.420
It might be someone coming for you.
Stay put.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.470
What in the...?

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:42.190
Why? My heart... It's beating so loudly.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.200
Can it be...?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.370
Is it?

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:10.840
I guess not.

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:13.220
Lucille, great work.

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:19.390
Sorry, but it's not over yet.

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:21.310
You puppet!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.520
Die!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.850
Damn you!

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:26.610
-Are you okay?
-Thanks.

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:31.530
An automaton!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:35.120
Human blood...

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.330
Mr. Masaru!

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:38.830
Shirogane.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.040
No, shirogane blood!

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:58.050
Who is it?

00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:05.940
-Narumi?
-Narumi!

00:22:14.530 --> 00:22:16.950
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:19.160
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:23.750
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:28.460
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:34.840
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:40.100
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:44.390
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.770
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:53.440
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.610 --> 00:22:57.780
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:02.910
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:09.040
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:11.340
become free

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:14.210
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.340
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.510 --> 00:23:20.890
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:25.730
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:32.190
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
